Subject: [PATCH] compulab: dts: Add selectable carrier peripheral support

Port the USB role variants, EB-EdgeRPI4 GPIO/RTC devices, HDMI/PAL CSI
adapters, and RS-485 UART from edge-ai-linux devel DTS patches 0002,
0004-0009. Keep optional peripherals in overlays rather than enabling
unfitted hardware in every base DTB. Include the matching Super base to
retain each module's identity and all existing carrier/PCIe/USB fixes.

The watchdog reference marks its GPIO assignments as draft. Supply a
compiled disabled template without guessing pins or changing the model.
Use only the dedicated RS-485 compatible to prevent competing drivers.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CompuLab Edge-AI carrier configuration]

